WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.960
Hello, followers of the four-year journey.

00:03.100 --> 00:06.220
This is Bob Lucas here on September 5th, 2026.

00:06.300 --> 00:06.880
I hope you're well.

00:07.440 --> 00:08.420
I know it's been a while.

00:08.500 --> 00:09.500
I hope you've enjoyed the summer.

00:10.200 --> 00:16.160
Major update here that the allocation is going to be adding 10 BTC to the portfolio.

00:17.060 --> 00:21.680
Obviously not at deep, deep lows that you would hope to see.

00:22.580 --> 00:26.380
And that's mostly a function of Bitcoin right now acting really strong.

00:26.380 --> 00:30.280
Now, I will do a full update on Tuesday.

00:30.500 --> 00:36.560
I'm currently away, not in an ideal environment or time to do an in-depth video.

00:36.980 --> 00:50.080
But the main view simply is that Bitcoin has now formed a swing on the monthly on a closing basis and has also closed above the 10-month moving average.

00:50.080 --> 00:56.240
And typically those are very high indicators of a possible bottom in place.

00:56.380 --> 01:07.260
Now, this bottom would have come slightly early than exactly the 48-month, coming in at 44 months, perfectly within the timing band for a cycle low but coming in earlier.

01:07.740 --> 01:14.360
And also the drawdown from the highs at around 50%, much milder than what we've seen in the past.

01:14.360 --> 01:21.960
So that makes it difficult to capture an absolute bottom or call an absolute bottom early.

01:22.160 --> 01:32.300
But there's also, on the flip side, no denying that this is strength and also indicative of an early bull phase market.

01:32.500 --> 01:34.420
So we're in those crossroads.

01:34.480 --> 01:36.120
We're in a transition phase.

01:36.120 --> 01:40.020
We don't have confirmation that the four-year cycle low is in.

01:40.620 --> 01:50.260
But, you know, if you have to wait for absolute confirmation, there's a chance that Bitcoin could be trading in a short period of time back above the 90,000 level.

01:50.420 --> 01:52.000
And that doesn't help as well.

01:52.000 --> 02:01.840
So it's a balance between looking at what the bullish elements to this market and also understanding that there's still potential downside here.

02:02.300 --> 02:14.160
So no confirmation yet of a four-year cycle low, but certainly enough confirming indicators on this chart to say that we need to get some or we should get some more allocation.

02:14.160 --> 02:20.580
And don't forget that the four-year HODL strategy is designed to be a HODL strategy in itself.

02:20.680 --> 02:33.500
So always wanting to have an allocation to Bitcoin and not to get too greedy when the market doesn't deliver absolute bottoms cleanly and right into the timing band, which makes it a lot easier.

02:33.640 --> 02:41.000
For example, a move down into October, November, down to the low 50s would be very easy to buy and add at that point.

02:41.000 --> 02:45.800
Sometimes the market doesn't always deliver a clean look like that.

02:45.980 --> 02:53.420
And here is a situation where, you know, you want to be adding because of the potential upside move.

02:53.680 --> 02:59.300
Understanding, though, that this market and Bitcoin historically doesn't make it easy for bulls or bears.

03:00.000 --> 03:06.840
And this, where we are right now, is not a clean bear structure, not a clean bull structure.

03:07.340 --> 03:09.760
And I think, again, it warrants the adding.

03:09.760 --> 03:17.700
Some dry capital, so here's the 10% allocation, sorry, 10 BTC allocation, still leaving around 15% in cash.

03:18.120 --> 03:32.480
And that is simply to say that there's still the chance here that even one, we retest this area or in the November, December timeframe, make a deeper low one last time where we could add some more of the dry powder.

03:32.480 --> 03:50.520
So the dry powder, and maybe there'll be more resolution by Tuesday's video, but the remaining dry powder will either be added at a higher level where there's more confirmation or wait it out for the drop down into November or December, whichever path Bitcoin decides to take.

03:50.520 --> 04:08.200
So I wanted to get this update out here in advance of a video next week, because the way Bitcoin is looking right now, there's a chant that this wants to continue moving higher, not look back, and don't want to be sort of chasing the market from that perspective.

04:08.720 --> 04:11.460
Wishing you all the best, and I'll see you on Tuesday.

04:11.460 --> 04:12.140
Take care.

04:12.140 --> 04:12.160
Take care.

